+
+## P8 Delivery and Operations
+
+P8 adds `/api/v2/projects/{project_id}/delivery-policies`, `/api/v2/deliveries`, Delivery intent/ready/merge/reconcile actions, read-only `/api/v2/imports`, operations list/replay, and CAS GC plan/apply. Mutations require `Idempotency-Key` plus expected revision. External or long-running actions return `202`; immutable resource creation returns `201`; queries return `200`. Merge, restore, reset, GC apply, cutover, and rollback require operator/session proof and explicit approval. Import mutation commands exist only as `aiws-import inspect|dry-run|run|resume|verify|cutover|rollback`.
diff --git a/docs/architecture/clean-schema.md b/docs/architecture/clean-schema.md
