 - Verify passes row, relation, event, ACL, CAS, credential, and golden checks.
 - Cutover and an actual rollback both pass health and behavior probes.
 - No source runtime directory is opened by the clean application after cutover.
+
+## P8 offline dual-source importer
+
+`apps/importer` is the only mutation owner. It reads V2.3 schema 23 and V3-Clean schema 7 in read-only mode and creates a fresh schema 8 database/CAS. The declarative `mapping-inventory.json` classifies source fields as `target`, `omitted`, or `blocking`; V3-Clean is canonical for equivalent semantic objects. Checkpoints are signed every 500 rows and at domain boundaries, and resume verifies source, plan, mapping, tool, and target hashes. Cutover atomically replaces an isolated deployment pointer only with a hash-bound approval created within 15 minutes.
